      <note>RetailFlow Master Pipeline (Pentaho engine)
Same 5 stages as the web app runner: Extract -> Load dimensions (SCD2) -> Load facts -> Data quality -> Reconcile.
Run is logged to ops.etl_run_log (engine = pentaho, trigger = pentaho) + ops.etl_stage_log, so it appears on the Runs / Monitoring pages.
Red hops = failure path: run marked failed, job aborts.</note>
